(2932127, 410787, 47541, '<td valign="top">5+2: Generally an OK image with a good capture on the coffee flowing into the cup.  All props in an image are taken into account with voters so I''d suggest staying away from controversial topics like religion if possible - a crossword in a newspaper would have been a better prop to use.  I''ll add on 2 points to compensate for some of those that will mark down for the bible being used.</td>', '5+2: Generally an OK image with a good capture on the coffee flowing into the cup.  All props in an image are taken into account with voters so I''d suggest staying away from controversial topics like religion if possible - a crossword in a newspaper would have been a better prop to use.  I''ll add on 2 points to compensate for some of those that will mark down for the bible being used.', '2006-10-16 03:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2932128, 411922, 47541, '<td valign="top">6: Cute kid!  The crop seems a bit strange as the kid is almost crammed into the corner.  I''d really like to see some colour too as I feel the pumpkin should be orange ;)</td>', '6: Cute kid!  The crop seems a bit strange as the kid is almost crammed into the corner.  I''d really like to see some colour too as I feel the pumpkin should be orange ;)', '2006-10-16 03:20:10.000000', NULL, 1);
