(2933114, 411732, 36382, '<td valign="top">Gotta give you props for actually doing this.  I had a similar idea, but that is all it was, an idea.  Can''t believe you actually did this.  Nice execution too.  The picture in the trees is a nice touch.</td>', 'Gotta give you props for actually doing this.  I had a similar idea, but that is all it was, an idea.  Can''t believe you actually did this.  Nice execution too.  The picture in the trees is a nice touch.', '2006-10-16 11:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933117, 412283, 64175, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic sunrise. The one thing I don''t like about it is the heavy straight line of clouds at the top. The reason, it is so thick and covers the entire horizontal boundary that it makes me think that is the top of the photo and then my eye catch more sky above it and says "wait, that should be below that cloudline.  Just my opinion of course.  <br/> <br/>A horizontal crop just below that cloudline would give you a 10, but with it I''m still going with a 9.</td>', 'This is a fantastic sunrise. The one thing I don''t like about it is the heavy straight line of clouds at the top. The reason, it is so thick and covers the entire horizontal boundary that it makes me think that is the top of the photo and then my eye catch more sky above it and says "wait, that should be below that cloudline.  Just my opinion of course.   A horizontal crop just below that cloudline would give you a 10, but with it I''m still going with a 9.', '2006-10-16 11:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933118, 410670, 64175, '<td valign="top">First 10 of the day. There are some really good ones in this challenge. Some may not like the flare in the top, but I do.</td>', 'First 10 of the day. There are some really good ones in this challenge. Some may not like the flare in the top, but I do.', '2006-10-16 11:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
