(2933464, 412295, 19944, '<td valign="top">Excellent crop, and nice shadows.  I feel like I''m right there.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Excellent crop, and nice shadows.  I feel like I''m right there.  Nicely done.', '2006-10-16 13:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933477, 410907, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely swathe of countryside there and well worth getting up early for this photo.  It rteminds me of somewhere in England or Wales. 10.</td>', 'Lovely swathe of countryside there and well worth getting up early for this photo.  It rteminds me of somewhere in England or Wales. 10.', '2006-10-16 13:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933478, 411866, 19944, '<td valign="top">The subject matter is...well, I''ll reserve comment.<br/> <br/>I will say, however, that I think it works well in black &amp; white, and I like the dark, soft focus you have created.</td>', 'The subject matter is...well, I''ll reserve comment. I will say, however, that I think it works well in black & white, and I like the dark, soft focus you have created.', '2006-10-16 13:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933479, 411218, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely tone and shadow in your photo.  The geometry of the open space is perfect. 10.</td>', 'Lovely tone and shadow in your photo.  The geometry of the open space is perfect. 10.', '2006-10-16 13:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933480, 411379, 51538, '<td valign="top">Love the three faces: the aspiring one; the real reflection; the desired one.  Works very well. 9.</td>', 'Love the three faces: the aspiring one; the real reflection; the desired one.  Works very well. 9.', '2006-10-16 13:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933483, 410470, 19944, '<td valign="top">OUTSTANDING!  I has a ''70s feel to it.  She looks down-trodden.  I really like the black &amp; white.</td>', 'OUTSTANDING!  I has a ''70s feel to it.  She looks down-trodden.  I really like the black & white.', '2006-10-16 13:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933486, 412134, 51538, '<td valign="top">Absolutely on of my favourites of this challenge.  Having grown up in England, this sight seems so real and reminds me of those days, whether or not your photo was taken there. 10.</td>', 'Absolutely on of my favourites of this challenge.  Having grown up in England, this sight seems so real and reminds me of those days, whether or not your photo was taken there. 10.', '2006-10-16 13:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933488, 412092, 51538, '<td valign="top">"The HDR effect" immediately springs to mind.  "Try to think beyond the effect" says another part of the mind.  It''s unreal.  It''s lovely, but unreal.  The composition is nice regardless of the effect.  I think I like it. 9. - back again: make that a 10.</td>', '"The HDR effect" immediately springs to mind.  "Try to think beyond the effect" says another part of the mind.  It''s unreal.  It''s lovely, but unreal.  The composition is nice regardless of the effect.  I think I like it. 9. - back again: make that a 10.', '2006-10-16 13:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933489, 410806, 51538, '<td valign="top">A true English robin.  Very nice image. 9.</td>', 'A true English robin.  Very nice image. 9.', '2006-10-16 13:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933493, 410670, 51538, '<td valign="top">So simple yet so lovely in effect.  Very nice work. 10.</td>', 'So simple yet so lovely in effect.  Very nice work. 10.', '2006-10-16 13:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933495, 412054, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed idea.  I look forward to learning more about the data. 9.</td>', 'Nicely executed idea.  I look forward to learning more about the data. 9.', '2006-10-16 13:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933496, 409204, 19944, '<td valign="top">Although this is an outstanding close-up of the owl, it just doesn''t scream "Morning" to me.  It is quite sharp, and the hint of light seems that it could be morning light.</td>', 'Although this is an outstanding close-up of the owl, it just doesn''t scream "Morning" to me.  It is quite sharp, and the hint of light seems that it could be morning light.', '2006-10-16 13:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933497, 411792, 51538, '<td valign="top">Magnificent.  Nicely framed. 9.</td>', 'Magnificent.  Nicely framed. 9.', '2006-10-16 13:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933498, 410814, 51538, '<td valign="top">It bespeaks the morning feeling exceptionally well. 9.</td>', 'It bespeaks the morning feeling exceptionally well. 9.', '2006-10-16 13:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933500, 409522, 19944, '<td valign="top">Great colors and silhouette.  I really like the natural framing, but I feel like the right side should have been cropped in a little closer.</td>', 'Great colors and silhouette.  I really like the natural framing, but I feel like the right side should have been cropped in a little closer.', '2006-10-16 13:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933502, 410907, 19944, '<td valign="top">Zowie!  This is stunning.  Great colors, great fog.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Zowie!  This is stunning.  Great colors, great fog.  Nicely done.', '2006-10-16 13:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933509, 411917, 19944, '<td valign="top">Nice morning light.  The couple walking along the path is a really nice touch.</td>', 'Nice morning light.  The couple walking along the path is a really nice touch.', '2006-10-16 13:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
