(2934071, 412323, 8860, '<td valign="top">Excellent take on the challenge! I''m not normally a fan of set-ups but this tickles me. <br/> <br/>I hope you confound expectations and score well, but ultimately it doesn''t matter because you''ve got a good image that''s memorable and outside the comfort zone. <br/> <br/>This would look marvellous in an East End bar.<br/> <br/>: j</td>', 'Excellent take on the challenge! I''m not normally a fan of set-ups but this tickles me.  I hope you confound expectations and score well, but ultimately it doesn''t matter because you''ve got a good image that''s memorable and outside the comfort zone.  This would look marvellous in an East End bar. : j', '2006-10-16 16:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
