(2934246, 408915, 65319, '<td valign="top">What I love about this photo is the fragmentation of life so cleary demonstrated with the newspaper clippings, and the serious nature of the young man''s portrait further emphasized by the grainy broodiness of the black and white.  A realistic and deep reminder of the world all our children wake up to.  10.</td>', 'What I love about this photo is the fragmentation of life so cleary demonstrated with the newspaper clippings, and the serious nature of the young man''s portrait further emphasized by the grainy broodiness of the black and white.  A realistic and deep reminder of the world all our children wake up to.  10.', '2006-10-16 17:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
