(2934538, 412282, 5354, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, but the image has little structure. The stream almost makes it, but really isn''t strong enough to impose itself.</td>', 'Nice colours, but the image has little structure. The stream almost makes it, but really isn''t strong enough to impose itself.', '2006-10-16 18:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934541, 412134, 5354, '<td valign="top">Brilliant</td>', 'Brilliant', '2006-10-16 18:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934543, 412258, 5354, '<td valign="top">Need to see theboot - move the hand out of the way!</td>', 'Need to see theboot - move the hand out of the way!', '2006-10-16 18:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934555, 411989, 5354, '<td valign="top">To make sports images work you have to isolate the action. Place yourself where you can get a clear background, anticipating where the action will come. This image has a car/auto encroaching on the left, but worse still is halfway through the kid. On the right, the other kid is halfway across the coach/ref.<br/>Keep it clean, isolate the action and you will do much better.</td>', 'To make sports images work you have to isolate the action. Place yourself where you can get a clear background, anticipating where the action will come. This image has a car/auto encroaching on the left, but worse still is halfway through the kid. On the right, the other kid is halfway across the coach/ref.Keep it clean, isolate the action and you will do much better.', '2006-10-16 18:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934556, 411718, 8860, '<td valign="top">Ignoring your typo [!] - the shot has some pleasant calming elements and colour. The DOF is a little too harsh as it tends to suggest that there''s a key element in focus when there is none. But I like it nonetheless.</td>', 'Ignoring your typo [!] - the shot has some pleasant calming elements and colour. The DOF is a little too harsh as it tends to suggest that there''s a key element in focus when there is none. But I like it nonetheless.', '2006-10-16 18:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934557, 412223, 33947, '<td valign="top">I like this one...like the way you caught him looking up and ready to take a sip. Neat smoke. Nice composition and positioning within frame. 7</td>', 'I like this one...like the way you caught him looking up and ready to take a sip. Neat smoke. Nice composition and positioning within frame. 7', '2006-10-16 18:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934564, 409701, 33947, '<td valign="top">Neat moment captured here. Warm. Nice subtle tones. 7</td>', 'Neat moment captured here. Warm. Nice subtle tones. 7', '2006-10-16 18:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934567, 410468, 33947, '<td valign="top">Like the simplicity. The light on the grass is nice. 7</td>', 'Like the simplicity. The light on the grass is nice. 7', '2006-10-16 18:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934570, 411147, 5354, '<td valign="top">I like this, just troubled by that branch at the top left. There is nothing to balance it and it therefore becomes a distraction.</td>', 'I like this, just troubled by that branch at the top left. There is nothing to balance it and it therefore becomes a distraction.', '2006-10-16 18:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934572, 409321, 33947, '<td valign="top">The clarity is super. 7</td>', 'The clarity is super. 7', '2006-10-16 18:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934574, 410481, 5354, '<td valign="top">Ribbon !!!!</td>', 'Ribbon !!!!', '2006-10-16 18:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934575, 411224, 33947, '<td valign="top">Neat mood captured. Like it. 7</td>', 'Neat mood captured. Like it. 7', '2006-10-16 18:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934576, 410817, 5354, '<td valign="top">Fantastic lighting, and angle. One of the best images of a horse I''ve seen.</td>', 'Fantastic lighting, and angle. One of the best images of a horse I''ve seen.', '2006-10-16 18:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934577, 411567, 5354, '<td valign="top">Morning rush ?? - so where''s the traffic?</td>', 'Morning rush ?? - so where''s the traffic?', '2006-10-16 18:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934582, 412019, 8860, '<td valign="top">There appears top be a bit of a trend for ''pinking'' shots at the moment which is a shame because it makes the photo quite gimmicky. Your composition here is a little too bland and leaves little space for evocative thought due to it all being filled with the boat. A more sky-weighted composition, with a crop on the left side would help perhaps.<br/> <br/>: j</td>', 'There appears top be a bit of a trend for ''pinking'' shots at the moment which is a shame because it makes the photo quite gimmicky. Your composition here is a little too bland and leaves little space for evocative thought due to it all being filled with the boat. A more sky-weighted composition, with a crop on the left side would help perhaps. : j', '2006-10-16 18:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934583, 411662, 33947, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit. Sky and water both are super. 7</td>', 'Beautifully lit. Sky and water both are super. 7', '2006-10-16 18:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934590, 410282, 5354, '<td valign="top">Gone a little too far with the saturation slider for my taste</td>', 'Gone a little too far with the saturation slider for my taste', '2006-10-16 18:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934591, 412019, 33947, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective on this, and how the boat is not in total silhouette. The lighting on the front beam is nice. 7</td>', 'I love the perspective on this, and how the boat is not in total silhouette. The lighting on the front beam is nice. 7', '2006-10-16 18:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934594, 411568, 8860, '<td valign="top">What a great scene slighthly spoiled some heavy-handed processing. It''s OK to leave a photo with its normal colouration, honestly - go on, buck a trend!<br/> <br/>You have a lovely subject wherever this is though.<br/>: j</td>', 'What a great scene slighthly spoiled some heavy-handed processing. It''s OK to leave a photo with its normal colouration, honestly - go on, buck a trend! You have a lovely subject wherever this is though.: j', '2006-10-16 18:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934596, 412310, 33947, '<td valign="top">Rich tones and good clarity. 7Nice reflective quality. 7</td>', 'Rich tones and good clarity. 7Nice reflective quality. 7', '2006-10-16 18:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934597, 410670, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love the layers of hills here, and the fog adds lots of interest. Like the serenity. 7</td>', 'Love the layers of hills here, and the fog adds lots of interest. Like the serenity. 7', '2006-10-16 18:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934598, 411675, 33947, '<td valign="top">Like the way the photo shows off the steamy fog. Also like the pink reflected in the water. Nice composition. 7</td>', 'Like the way the photo shows off the steamy fog. Also like the pink reflected in the water. Nice composition. 7', '2006-10-16 18:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934599, 410907, 8860, '<td valign="top">A wondrous view - the land up close looks a little too light compared to mid-ground, but it''s a nit-pick. A hot air ballon floating above those clouds would wrap this up for sure!<br/> <br/>: j</td>', 'A wondrous view - the land up close looks a little too light compared to mid-ground, but it''s a nit-pick. A hot air ballon floating above those clouds would wrap this up for sure! : j', '2006-10-16 18:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
