(2935977, 411718, 37629, '<td valign="top">This is absolutley terrific, the depth of field is very amazing.<br/>It''s almost abstract, yet identifiable. The cool colors do a very good job of giving me an impression of the morning. The blurred circles in the background remind me of morning dew. Great!</td>', 'This is absolutley terrific, the depth of field is very amazing.It''s almost abstract, yet identifiable. The cool colors do a very good job of giving me an impression of the morning. The blurred circles in the background remind me of morning dew. Great!', '2006-10-17 09:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936170, 411966, 60341, '<td valign="top">I love this one. It''s so still and untouched looking, but the slide shows a past and previous (loud, breaking the stillness) childsplay, which really contrasts with the stillness.</td>', 'I love this one. It''s so still and untouched looking, but the slide shows a past and previous (loud, breaking the stillness) childsplay, which really contrasts with the stillness.', '2006-10-17 11:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936174, 409262, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is certainly a Wow Photo!!  :)   I love those golden silhouettes!  What a tranquil, beautiful scene!</td>', 'This is certainly a Wow Photo!!  :)   I love those golden silhouettes!  What a tranquil, beautiful scene!', '2006-10-17 11:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936176, 411068, 60341, '<td valign="top">Even though this is just another sunrise over the ocean, it stands out from the rest for me. Yellow represents morning for me. The birds are coming in, showing the first sign of animals awaking. They make the picture, IMO.</td>', 'Even though this is just another sunrise over the ocean, it stands out from the rest for me. Yellow represents morning for me. The birds are coming in, showing the first sign of animals awaking. They make the picture, IMO.', '2006-10-17 11:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
