(2936178, 412239, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwww. . .I have never in all my years of animal watching seen a baby nursing zebra!   This is so awesome!  I think I better add this one to my favorites!  Good luck!  I truly love this photo!  10</td>', 'Awwwww. . .I have never in all my years of animal watching seen a baby nursing zebra!   This is so awesome!  I think I better add this one to my favorites!  Good luck!  I truly love this photo!  10', '2006-10-17 11:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
