(2936194, 411966, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo.  I can hear the silence and feel the cool air.  It makes me think of the "end of summer" when the water is too cold to swim in and the kids have all gone back to school.  This photo also represents a great ''eye'' for an image.  The lines and shapes here are strong and the time of day along with the conditions nicely isolated the subject and created a really nice mood for the photo... great work :)</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo.  I can hear the silence and feel the cool air.  It makes me think of the "end of summer" when the water is too cold to swim in and the kids have all gone back to school.  This photo also represents a great ''eye'' for an image.  The lines and shapes here are strong and the time of day along with the conditions nicely isolated the subject and created a really nice mood for the photo... great work :)', '2006-10-17 11:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
