(2936459, 412162, 32968, '<td valign="top">Brilliant color, nice idea for a pic, a little bit of action as well, a "kerplunk" would add so much to this...I guess we have to wait forever :)</td>', 'Brilliant color, nice idea for a pic, a little bit of action as well, a "kerplunk" would add so much to this...I guess we have to wait forever :)', '2006-10-17 13:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
