(2936475, 412170, 32968, '<td valign="top">A bit dark, and a little bit blurry in spots, but we can still see plenty of detail in this absolutely beautiful piece of landscape. Nice catch</td>', 'A bit dark, and a little bit blurry in spots, but we can still see plenty of detail in this absolutely beautiful piece of landscape. Nice catch', '2006-10-17 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
