(2936515, 412087, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s a lovely view for the church and it''s visitors.  Too bad you didn''t get in place for this photo about 5 minutes sooner and captured it before the sun broke the horizon.  I like the similarity of the rocks and the scattering clouds - kind of a mirrored pattern in a way.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'That''s a lovely view for the church and it''s visitors.  Too bad you didn''t get in place for this photo about 5 minutes sooner and captured it before the sun broke the horizon.  I like the similarity of the rocks and the scattering clouds - kind of a mirrored pattern in a way.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-17 13:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936529, 412313, 48248, '<td valign="top">Nice color</td>', 'Nice color', '2006-10-17 13:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936549, 412092, 327, '<td valign="top">Love the rich, strong coloring. Good entry.</td>', 'Love the rich, strong coloring. Good entry.', '2006-10-17 13:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936640, 412092, 23484, '<td valign="top">I really like how vibrant the colors are and the way the sun reflects off the boats. Something about the clouds look odd but I can''t put my finger on it.  Good job though. 7</td>', 'I really like how vibrant the colors are and the way the sun reflects off the boats. Something about the clouds look odd but I can''t put my finger on it.  Good job though. 7', '2006-10-17 14:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936649, 410806, 23484, '<td valign="top">Supurb shot. The sharpness is dead on.  I just don''t see the reference to morning.</td>', 'Supurb shot. The sharpness is dead on.  I just don''t see the reference to morning.', '2006-10-17 14:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936653, 410907, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors.  I really like the softness of the whole image.</td>', 'Very nice colors.  I really like the softness of the whole image.', '2006-10-17 14:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936654, 412170, 32378, '<td valign="top">Outstanding color and use of light.</td>', 'Outstanding color and use of light.', '2006-10-17 14:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936657, 412087, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. The stones and the sky are like leading lines that leady you to the church. 8</td>', 'Very nicely done. The stones and the sky are like leading lines that leady you to the church. 8', '2006-10-17 14:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936658, 410670, 23484, '<td valign="top">Best I''ve seen yet.  Excellent. 10</td>', 'Best I''ve seen yet.  Excellent. 10', '2006-10-17 14:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936664, 410468, 23484, '<td valign="top">This definitely has a WOW factor.  Excelent job on the colors and contrast. 10</td>', 'This definitely has a WOW factor.  Excelent job on the colors and contrast. 10', '2006-10-17 14:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936682, 409991, 60173, '<td valign="top">Pet peeve - I can see you in the spoon.  =)</td>', 'Pet peeve - I can see you in the spoon.  =)', '2006-10-17 14:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936692, 411370, 60173, '<td valign="top">Looks kinda cool as a thumbnail, but then at full size.. ugh. (For obvious reasons I hope)</td>', 'Looks kinda cool as a thumbnail, but then at full size.. ugh. (For obvious reasons I hope)', '2006-10-17 14:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936709, 411966, 60173, '<td valign="top">As it is now I think the water could use more ripples. I was thinking maybe if you had thrown a big rock out there and waited a few seconds? <br/> <br/>If the minimalist look was more what you were going for cropping the reflection out and showing more sky would add to it. <br/> <br/>I just noticed something. The bottom side of the slide has a great rustic texture. It would be cool to see that brought out more.</td>', 'As it is now I think the water could use more ripples. I was thinking maybe if you had thrown a big rock out there and waited a few seconds?  If the minimalist look was more what you were going for cropping the reflection out and showing more sky would add to it.  I just noticed something. The bottom side of the slide has a great rustic texture. It would be cool to see that brought out more.', '2006-10-17 14:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936717, 412204, 60173, '<td valign="top">Am I wrong for loving this? Am I wrong for thinking Grandma''s cleavage makes the photo?</td>', 'Am I wrong for loving this? Am I wrong for thinking Grandma''s cleavage makes the photo?', '2006-10-17 14:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936721, 410814, 60173, '<td valign="top">The pop bottle takes me out of the "mood."</td>', 'The pop bottle takes me out of the "mood."', '2006-10-17 14:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936729, 408862, 60173, '<td valign="top">This feels cramped. <br/> <br/>Good focus. I don''t think the steam is used to its potential though.</td>', 'This feels cramped.  Good focus. I don''t think the steam is used to its potential though.', '2006-10-17 15:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936760, 411311, 60173, '<td valign="top">I''m distracted by whatever the light source is. It looks to be a low single source whereas my mind expects a hallway light through a cracked door which would go higher. <br/> <br/>Basically.. your light source bugs me. Nice idea though, heh.</td>', 'I''m distracted by whatever the light source is. It looks to be a low single source whereas my mind expects a hallway light through a cracked door which would go higher.  Basically.. your light source bugs me. Nice idea though, heh.', '2006-10-17 15:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936815, 411562, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like an interesting old building.  As for the image I''m not seeing anything really stand out as the subject.  I guess the branches actually coming thru the window have the biggest impact.  I find the blownout background a bit distracting.  A shallower DOF could have blurred that more and taken that element/distraction away from the viewer.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like an interesting old building.  As for the image I''m not seeing anything really stand out as the subject.  I guess the branches actually coming thru the window have the biggest impact.  I find the blownout background a bit distracting.  A shallower DOF could have blurred that more and taken that element/distraction away from the viewer.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-17 15:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936818, 409387, 30049, '<td valign="top">Never mind the question; How does this answer the question, "What does morning mean to you." ???<br/> <br/>After looking at many of the challenge entries it seems that my take on the challenge is at odds with the majority.  :D<br/> <br/>This would have been a nice entry for the HC II challenge.  I like your choice of composition.  It gives a nice feel for action and motion.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Never mind the question; How does this answer the question, "What does morning mean to you." ??? After looking at many of the challenge entries it seems that my take on the challenge is at odds with the majority.  :D This would have been a nice entry for the HC II challenge.  I like your choice of composition.  It gives a nice feel for action and motion.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-17 15:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936826, 412232, 327, '<td valign="top">It''s rare that I like ''food'' shots. The reason is they are often very poorly done and unappetizing. I will have to say that you really did a wonderful job here. The light,colors and the composition all come together to make a very fine entry. Congrats!!!!</td>', 'It''s rare that I like ''food'' shots. The reason is they are often very poorly done and unappetizing. I will have to say that you really did a wonderful job here. The light,colors and the composition all come together to make a very fine entry. Congrats!!!!', '2006-10-17 15:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936827, 412067, 327, '<td valign="top">Love this, awesome light and sets a fantastic mood.</td>', 'Love this, awesome light and sets a fantastic mood.', '2006-10-17 15:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936829, 409522, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice entry-good luck.</td>', 'Nice entry-good luck.', '2006-10-17 15:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936831, 412032, 327, '<td valign="top">Good composition, focus and tones. Best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good composition, focus and tones. Best of luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-17 15:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936833, 412223, 327, '<td valign="top">Well done. I can relate to the mood of this shot.</td>', 'Well done. I can relate to the mood of this shot.', '2006-10-17 15:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936835, 411672, 327, '<td valign="top">Really nice silhouette, love the deep,rich blue.</td>', 'Really nice silhouette, love the deep,rich blue.', '2006-10-17 15:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936837, 411379, 327, '<td valign="top">Too funny. I swear there have been times I looked just like that. Fun entry, good luck.</td>', 'Too funny. I swear there have been times I looked just like that. Fun entry, good luck.', '2006-10-17 15:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936839, 412134, 327, '<td valign="top">Love the casual, natural feel of this shot. Really a great find.</td>', 'Love the casual, natural feel of this shot. Really a great find.', '2006-10-17 15:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936840, 411376, 327, '<td valign="top">Great humor, and his expression is so perfect. Love it.</td>', 'Great humor, and his expression is so perfect. Love it.', '2006-10-17 15:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936841, 412162, 327, '<td valign="top">excellent entry.</td>', 'excellent entry.', '2006-10-17 15:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936843, 411156, 327, '<td valign="top">what a great spot this is, so still and the light was really nice!</td>', 'what a great spot this is, so still and the light was really nice!', '2006-10-17 15:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936846, 412054, 327, '<td valign="top">Your wasting water! This is really a nice shot for the challenge. Well done.</td>', 'Your wasting water! This is really a nice shot for the challenge. Well done.', '2006-10-17 15:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936866, 412140, 64175, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Not sure if minimalistic is the right word, but for lack of a better one, let''s say simplisitc.  Great tones and clarity.  A 9.</td>', 'Very nice. Not sure if minimalistic is the right word, but for lack of a better one, let''s say simplisitc.  Great tones and clarity.  A 9.', '2006-10-17 15:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936871, 412172, 64175, '<td valign="top">This looks more like a sunset to me than sunrise (not implying it is not a sunrise). the reds of the sky are very nice. 6.</td>', 'This looks more like a sunset to me than sunrise (not implying it is not a sunrise). the reds of the sky are very nice. 6.', '2006-10-17 15:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936879, 411662, 64175, '<td valign="top">A little too much texture between the whispy clouds and the rippled water for my taste.  Great composition and blue colors.</td>', 'A little too much texture between the whispy clouds and the rippled water for my taste.  Great composition and blue colors.', '2006-10-17 16:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936882, 411580, 64175, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of negative (not sure it could be called that here) space in this one as the cloud does feel like it is going to engulf the derrick. 9.</td>', 'Very nice use of negative (not sure it could be called that here) space in this one as the cloud does feel like it is going to engulf the derrick. 9.', '2006-10-17 16:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936885, 411128, 64175, '<td valign="top">Don''t you hate it when your crossword puzzle gets soggy? :)</td>', 'Don''t you hate it when your crossword puzzle gets soggy? :)', '2006-10-17 16:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936886, 411307, 64175, '<td valign="top">Too much negative space.  if the contrast was a bit more stark rather than graduated from the fog, then the extra negative space may have been more effective.  With those elements I would have cropped down just a bit and it would have been more effective.</td>', 'Too much negative space.  if the contrast was a bit more stark rather than graduated from the fog, then the extra negative space may have been more effective.  With those elements I would have cropped down just a bit and it would have been more effective.', '2006-10-17 16:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936893, 409063, 64175, '<td valign="top">Shot has a good bit of noise to it, but capturing a doe in the morning is not easy.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Shot has a good bit of noise to it, but capturing a doe in the morning is not easy.  Nice shot.', '2006-10-17 16:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936897, 412216, 64175, '<td valign="top">Hey, I think I''ve seen this subject a few times in recent challenges. Nice rock formation.  Wish there were a bit more color in the skyline, but that''s hard on an overcast day. It''s hard to determine what time of day is really being shown and if it were not for the challenge criteria, I would have thought this was a rainy afternoon pic.</td>', 'Hey, I think I''ve seen this subject a few times in recent challenges. Nice rock formation.  Wish there were a bit more color in the skyline, but that''s hard on an overcast day. It''s hard to determine what time of day is really being shown and if it were not for the challenge criteria, I would have thought this was a rainy afternoon pic.', '2006-10-17 16:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936899, 411149, 64175, '<td valign="top">I actually wish the croissant had not had a bite taken out of it. Good composition and colors.</td>', 'I actually wish the croissant had not had a bite taken out of it. Good composition and colors.', '2006-10-17 16:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936908, 411192, 64175, '<td valign="top">A crop just below the bright glare of the sun may add a little something to this. Nice composition.</td>', 'A crop just below the bright glare of the sun may add a little something to this. Nice composition.', '2006-10-17 16:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936909, 411583, 64175, '<td valign="top">A bit too much pink in the picture for me. It takes over the whole phot and makes me think the color may have been off.  Perhaps if the pink had been graduated over the water ending in a blue, it would have come off better.  Not a bad photo by any means, just too pink for my taste.</td>', 'A bit too much pink in the picture for me. It takes over the whole phot and makes me think the color may have been off.  Perhaps if the pink had been graduated over the water ending in a blue, it would have come off better.  Not a bad photo by any means, just too pink for my taste.', '2006-10-17 16:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936913, 412281, 64175, '<td valign="top">Cloud line appears blurred. Perhaps that''s just the way the lighting comes off in the cloud relection, but it gives me the impression it is out of focus. Nice composition and framing of the subject.</td>', 'Cloud line appears blurred. Perhaps that''s just the way the lighting comes off in the cloud relection, but it gives me the impression it is out of focus. Nice composition and framing of the subject.', '2006-10-17 16:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936927, 411932, 64175, '<td valign="top">The overcast clouds give this a look of later afternoon or dusk moreso than a morning walk.</td>', 'The overcast clouds give this a look of later afternoon or dusk moreso than a morning walk.', '2006-10-17 16:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2936939, 412176, 64175, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic shot. I look forward to reading about where you took it (vantage point).  I love the big NO as its not far away from where I grew up.  Great horizon colors.  The main street looks just a bit hazy but it is early in the morning and the light may just be providing that effect. The only other area I could see that might need a touchup is the really bright red sign or flare just above and to the left of the Loews sign as it is a little distracting.   -9-</td>', 'This is a fantastic shot. I look forward to reading about where you took it (vantage point).  I love the big NO as its not far away from where I grew up.  Great horizon colors.  The main street looks just a bit hazy but it is early in the morning and the light may just be providing that effect. The only other area I could see that might need a touchup is the really bright red sign or flare just above and to the left of the Loews sign as it is a little distracting.   -9-', '2006-10-17 16:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
