(2937931, 411932, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like the general idea.  the surroundings seem so odd for the commentary though.  seems almost like no beginning and no end.  perhaps that was your intention.  your added blur does not improve the image for me.  though going a bit further and blurring everything but the road and the couple seems intriguing to me and would comment to me on how life passes for some before they know it and really get to experience anything of value for themselves.  like waiting for retirement and then finding it was just like walking down a blurry road of hazy memories and dead grass.</td>', 'i like the general idea.  the surroundings seem so odd for the commentary though.  seems almost like no beginning and no end.  perhaps that was your intention.  your added blur does not improve the image for me.  though going a bit further and blurring everything but the road and the couple seems intriguing to me and would comment to me on how life passes for some before they know it and really get to experience anything of value for themselves.  like waiting for retirement and then finding it was just like walking down a blurry road of hazy memories and dead grass.', '2006-10-17 22:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2937932, 411922, 60698, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white photo!! Sharp and appealing. What a cutie! Maybe if the person wasn''t in the background and his little hand wasn''t cut off it would have been perfect. But...It''s hard to get the little ones where you want them!</td>', 'Nice black and white photo!! Sharp and appealing. What a cutie! Maybe if the person wasn''t in the background and his little hand wasn''t cut off it would have been perfect. But...It''s hard to get the little ones where you want them!', '2006-10-17 22:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2937955, 410655, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like that you have made a statement or memorial with your submission.  i like how meticulous you are with the placement of your composition, down to the fake sugar packet.  in today''s fast moving society it would be interesting to see a headline in the paper that was indeed a surprise the next "morning"</td>', 'i like that you have made a statement or memorial with your submission.  i like how meticulous you are with the placement of your composition, down to the fake sugar packet.  in today''s fast moving society it would be interesting to see a headline in the paper that was indeed a surprise the next "morning"', '2006-10-17 22:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
