(2941603, 410813, 59740, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Ho hum execution. It doesn''t keep my attention.</td>', 'Good idea. Ho hum execution. It doesn''t keep my attention.', '2006-10-18 19:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2941606, 412323, 59740, '<td valign="top">Clever. I don''t know if the picture stands alone without the caption?</td>', 'Clever. I don''t know if the picture stands alone without the caption?', '2006-10-18 19:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2941607, 409138, 59740, '<td valign="top">Good try. To me, it''s too washed out with not enought detail.</td>', 'Good try. To me, it''s too washed out with not enought detail.', '2006-10-18 19:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2941609, 411588, 59740, '<td valign="top">If this is real it is surreal. Looks oversaturated.</td>', 'If this is real it is surreal. Looks oversaturated.', '2006-10-18 19:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2941614, 411501, 59740, '<td valign="top">This has the makings of a great picture but to me the composition lacks. The groups of mountains seem to be fighting to be the "subject". I would have cropped severely to eliminate all but the "white" looking mountain to the right of center. Also, the large mass of trees is not sharp and is uninteresting.</td>', 'This has the makings of a great picture but to me the composition lacks. The groups of mountains seem to be fighting to be the "subject". I would have cropped severely to eliminate all but the "white" looking mountain to the right of center. Also, the large mass of trees is not sharp and is uninteresting.', '2006-10-18 19:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2941621, 411219, 59740, '<td valign="top">I like the stoplight and the early morning scene but the overexposed street light with the attendant lens flare messes it up.</td>', 'I like the stoplight and the early morning scene but the overexposed street light with the attendant lens flare messes it up.', '2006-10-18 19:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2941622, 411600, 59740, '<td valign="top">Too much of a good thing. Overexposed.</td>', 'Too much of a good thing. Overexposed.', '2006-10-18 19:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2941627, 411917, 59740, '<td valign="top">Good shot of early morning LA. Try cropping off the fountain for a tighter more cogent composition.</td>', 'Good shot of early morning LA. Try cropping off the fountain for a tighter more cogent composition.', '2006-10-18 19:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2941630, 408915, 59740, '<td valign="top">Good idea but not subtle enough. Leaves nothing to the imagination.</td>', 'Good idea but not subtle enough. Leaves nothing to the imagination.', '2006-10-18 19:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2941634, 412282, 59740, '<td valign="top">Amazing color. I think it would be even better if taken a little earlier.</td>', 'Amazing color. I think it would be even better if taken a little earlier.', '2006-10-18 19:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2941635, 411932, 59740, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but doesn''t necessarily say morning.</td>', 'Nice picture but doesn''t necessarily say morning.', '2006-10-18 19:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2941641, 412176, 59740, '<td valign="top">Nice color and goood composition with the curved line taking the eye from building to building.</td>', 'Nice color and goood composition with the curved line taking the eye from building to building.', '2006-10-18 19:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2941686, 412223, 57202, '<td valign="top">Finally a well-done coffee photo!  Excellent choice going with B&amp;W, and I think the border works well with the shot.  Very good use of DOF to draw focus to your subject.  This shot epitomizes "morning" to me. :)</td>', 'Finally a well-done coffee photo!  Excellent choice going with B&W, and I think the border works well with the shot.  Very good use of DOF to draw focus to your subject.  This shot epitomizes "morning" to me. :)', '2006-10-18 20:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2941693, 412170, 57202, '<td valign="top">This should be a poster somewhere... :)  Good balance between highlights and shadows.  Rich &amp; vibrant colors and I love the "soft water" effect on the waterfall from the longer exposure.  AWESOME shot. :D</td>', 'This should be a poster somewhere... :)  Good balance between highlights and shadows.  Rich & vibrant colors and I love the "soft water" effect on the waterfall from the longer exposure.  AWESOME shot. :D', '2006-10-18 20:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2941697, 411128, 32345, '<td valign="top">LOL</td>', 'LOL', '2006-10-18 20:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2941705, 411297, 57202, '<td valign="top">Great balance between highlights and shadows.  The colors in this are amazing!  I normally don''t like shots split down the middle of the frame by the horizon, but I can see here that it was a compositional decision.  Keeping the tree along the upper third without cutting the top off makes this composition the best choice.  Well done. :)</td>', 'Great balance between highlights and shadows.  The colors in this are amazing!  I normally don''t like shots split down the middle of the frame by the horizon, but I can see here that it was a compositional decision.  Keeping the tree along the upper third without cutting the top off makes this composition the best choice.  Well done. :)', '2006-10-18 20:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2941794, 411772, 24528, '<td valign="top">Look tasty....</td>', 'Look tasty....', '2006-10-18 20:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942129, 411219, 23484, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t make sense to me. Maybe I''m just missing something.</td>', 'This doesn''t make sense to me. Maybe I''m just missing something.', '2006-10-18 22:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
