(2944613, 411156, 67257, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Reminds me of a morning on the Chesapeake.  Even though you do not see the sun you can still tell it is early from the low light on the boat which creates the reflection in the water.  I love it.</td>', 'Great shot.  Reminds me of a morning on the Chesapeake.  Even though you do not see the sun you can still tell it is early from the low light on the boat which creates the reflection in the water.  I love it.', '2006-10-19 17:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2944623, 411614, 67257, '<td valign="top">You might think at first this is just a picture of a traffic jam.  I am giving it a 10 however because of the feeling it gave me.  As soon as a saw it I got a knot in my stomach just thinking about drive to work in the mornings.  I think great pictures are ones that make the person viewing it feel something and this gave me a strong feeling.</td>', 'You might think at first this is just a picture of a traffic jam.  I am giving it a 10 however because of the feeling it gave me.  As soon as a saw it I got a knot in my stomach just thinking about drive to work in the mornings.  I think great pictures are ones that make the person viewing it feel something and this gave me a strong feeling.', '2006-10-19 17:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2944638, 410468, 67257, '<td valign="top">Great color combination and i like the shadow running across the picture from the tree out the right hand side.</td>', 'Great color combination and i like the shadow running across the picture from the tree out the right hand side.', '2006-10-19 17:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2944646, 410877, 67257, '<td valign="top">Great use of light and shadow.  I like the placement of the cup so the light is on the handle yet casting a shadow on the handle.</td>', 'Great use of light and shadow.  I like the placement of the cup so the light is on the handle yet casting a shadow on the handle.', '2006-10-19 17:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2944657, 411671, 67257, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of your glasses.  Did you create the effect using Photoshop or did you focuse the camera through your glasses?</td>', 'Interesting use of your glasses.  Did you create the effect using Photoshop or did you focuse the camera through your glasses?', '2006-10-19 17:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2944660, 412217, 67257, '<td valign="top">Done that...</td>', 'Done that...', '2006-10-19 17:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2944663, 410481, 67257, '<td valign="top">I like the picture but if i didn''t read the title i wouldn''t have known why this fit the catagory "MORNING"</td>', 'I like the picture but if i didn''t read the title i wouldn''t have known why this fit the catagory "MORNING"', '2006-10-19 17:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
