(2944924, 411662, 59740, '<td valign="top">This scene has possibilities but has no focus. The bit of bush in the lower left corner is too small and uninteresting. I think it would be improved by cropping off most of the water below the boat docks and increasing the contrast a little.</td>', 'This scene has possibilities but has no focus. The bit of bush in the lower left corner is too small and uninteresting. I think it would be improved by cropping off most of the water below the boat docks and increasing the contrast a little.', '2006-10-19 19:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
