(2945677, 411916, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very lovely, clear image. You''re right! the best reflections are always in the morning for some reason. Your horizon line is almost in the middle; you might try putting it directly in the center or moving it to a third to see what''ll happen. Super work! 9</td>', 'Very lovely, clear image. You''re right! the best reflections are always in the morning for some reason. Your horizon line is almost in the middle; you might try putting it directly in the center or moving it to a third to see what''ll happen. Super work! 9', '2006-10-19 23:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
