(2946811, 411866, 64175, '<td valign="top">Ha, Ha (lol).  I just did this same type of photo on faceless. It actually generated my highest score to date (not sure if that''s anything to brag about, lol).<br/> <br/>Good sense of humor.</td>', 'Ha, Ha (lol).  I just did this same type of photo on faceless. It actually generated my highest score to date (not sure if that''s anything to brag about, lol). Good sense of humor.', '2006-10-20 11:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2946814, 411919, 64175, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the photo (and subjects) is a bit dark. Might suggest a tighter crop on the left side as the shadow on the wall made from the paper is distracting.</td>', 'The lighting on the photo (and subjects) is a bit dark. Might suggest a tighter crop on the left side as the shadow on the wall made from the paper is distracting.', '2006-10-20 11:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2946819, 411423, 64175, '<td valign="top">I like the shot of the glass and egg, but i think the grid pattern (glass) takes away from the shot and leaves me wanting more clarity or sharpness in the photo.</td>', 'I like the shot of the glass and egg, but i think the grid pattern (glass) takes away from the shot and leaves me wanting more clarity or sharpness in the photo.', '2006-10-20 11:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2946820, 410547, 64175, '<td valign="top">The speckles in teh cup first come off as if they were photo noise. Then the blacks in the photo help clarify it a bit.  Nice composition regarding a simple setup and the lighting is good.</td>', 'The speckles in teh cup first come off as if they were photo noise. Then the blacks in the photo help clarify it a bit.  Nice composition regarding a simple setup and the lighting is good.', '2006-10-20 11:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2946825, 409964, 64175, '<td valign="top">The shot is nice and clear. I like the white background contrasting with the black rim followed byt he shiny stainless.  I don''t really like the colors of the food itself.  On their own (each color) is fine, but when put together it does not look very appetizing or do much (IMO) to help the photo.<br/> <br/>I get the title and it is appropriate and no dog food should not be appealing to man, but the colors do need to appeal to the viewer.  <br/> <br/>Very nice composition.  I''m doing a bump up on the score now for the technical aspects of the photo.</td>', 'The shot is nice and clear. I like the white background contrasting with the black rim followed byt he shiny stainless.  I don''t really like the colors of the food itself.  On their own (each color) is fine, but when put together it does not look very appetizing or do much (IMO) to help the photo. I get the title and it is appropriate and no dog food should not be appealing to man, but the colors do need to appeal to the viewer.   Very nice composition.  I''m doing a bump up on the score now for the technical aspects of the photo.', '2006-10-20 11:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2946826, 412255, 64175, '<td valign="top">The shot is fine, but I don''t like the angle of the image. I would prefer to see it rotated then cropped (maybe the vertical crop a little closer tot he red hanging ''patience'' sign as the area to the right of it does not enhance the photo.</td>', 'The shot is fine, but I don''t like the angle of the image. I would prefer to see it rotated then cropped (maybe the vertical crop a little closer tot he red hanging ''patience'' sign as the area to the right of it does not enhance the photo.', '2006-10-20 11:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2946832, 411671, 64175, '<td valign="top">The processing is very nice. I like that the monitor is only clearly visbile through the left lens. The right lens then takes on a sepia tone which doesn''t really go with the bright white seen in the left lens. Ultimately, the photo does not convey any impression of "Morning" to me as a viewer but the challenge is "what is morning to YOU" so if this is morning, so be it.</td>', 'The processing is very nice. I like that the monitor is only clearly visbile through the left lens. The right lens then takes on a sepia tone which doesn''t really go with the bright white seen in the left lens. Ultimately, the photo does not convey any impression of "Morning" to me as a viewer but the challenge is "what is morning to YOU" so if this is morning, so be it.', '2006-10-20 11:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2946833, 411370, 64175, '<td valign="top">Negative IMage processing?  The biggest aspect of what throws me off on this one is I see the coffee cup, I don''t see the paper, and the slipper looks like it is on the model''s hand rather than foot. <br/> <br/>I like that you tried something different from many of the other entries.  Refreshing.</td>', 'Negative IMage processing?  The biggest aspect of what throws me off on this one is I see the coffee cup, I don''t see the paper, and the slipper looks like it is on the model''s hand rather than foot.  I like that you tried something different from many of the other entries.  Refreshing.', '2006-10-20 11:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2946836, 408915, 64175, '<td valign="top">Too much noise in the photo for my taste.  Had to come back to this one and it is due a bump up in score as it is insightful.</td>', 'Too much noise in the photo for my taste.  Had to come back to this one and it is due a bump up in score as it is insightful.', '2006-10-20 11:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2946837, 412229, 64175, '<td valign="top">I think you had the right concept going here but the color scheme in the room doesn''t really enhance the subject.  These are merely suggestions from an ameteur so take them for what they are worth.<br/> <br/>1)  The angle of the phot comes off titled and makes you want to turn your head to get things in alignment. Might suggest a different crop and rotation.<br/> <br/>2)  The colors are all very neutral. I can see just on the right bottom edge that something had some yellow and reds and those colors would have been a nice addition.  Right now everything gets lost as there is no color contrast.<br/> <br/>3) Not sure (or at least not positive) that the title is conveying what you want to convey.  It is probably, "First things first" from the aspect of time to hit the commode upon waking.  But, with the bath products barely visible in the bottom right, it could be that you want to emphasize that you neeed to wash hands, put on deodorant, or brush teeth first.<br/> <br/>As stated above, I think you were on to the right idea, it just did not come off, to me, in the best fashion this time.  <br/> <br/>Anyway, I hope at least a little of this above is useful.</td>', 'I think you had the right concept going here but the color scheme in the room doesn''t really enhance the subject.  These are merely suggestions from an ameteur so take them for what they are worth. 1)  The angle of the phot comes off titled and makes you want to turn your head to get things in alignment. Might suggest a different crop and rotation. 2)  The colors are all very neutral. I can see just on the right bottom edge that something had some yellow and reds and those colors would have been a nice addition.  Right now everything gets lost as there is no color contrast. 3) Not sure (or at least not positive) that the title is conveying what you want to convey.  It is probably, "First things first" from the aspect of time to hit the commode upon waking.  But, with the bath products barely visible in the bottom right, it could be that you want to emphasize that you neeed to wash hands, put on deodorant, or brush teeth first. As stated above, I think you were on to the right idea, it just did not come off, to me, in the best fashion this time.   Anyway, I hope at least a little of this above is useful.', '2006-10-20 11:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2946839, 410806, 64175, '<td valign="top">I can''t imagine how long it took for that shot to develop or was it just an extremely patient bird? 7.</td>', 'I can''t imagine how long it took for that shot to develop or was it just an extremely patient bird? 7.', '2006-10-20 11:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
