(2946847, 412032, 64175, '<td valign="top">America''s great cash vacuum.  My wife loves this stuff.  It''s in the same category as diapers where you say "I wish I had stock in that company".<br/> <br/>I like the photo. The starbucks wording on the shot glass is a bit shadowed and takes away just a bit because I am search for the items in focus.  Nice DOF.</td>', 'America''s great cash vacuum.  My wife loves this stuff.  It''s in the same category as diapers where you say "I wish I had stock in that company". I like the photo. The starbucks wording on the shot glass is a bit shadowed and takes away just a bit because I am search for the items in focus.  Nice DOF.', '2006-10-20 11:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2946849, 411204, 64175, '<td valign="top">Very abstract and nice colors.  A good refreshing entry to all of the sunrises and coffee cups that everyone is submitting.</td>', 'Very abstract and nice colors.  A good refreshing entry to all of the sunrises and coffee cups that everyone is submitting.', '2006-10-20 11:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2946893, 412313, 67381, '<td valign="top">nice colour</td>', 'nice colour', '2006-10-20 11:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2946985, 412204, 65319, '<td valign="top">I love the tonal quality of this picture and the detail especially in the beautiful lace.  Some halo appears around the bed post as a minor distraction to me.  This portrait is a very intimate and brave look into the life of a tremendous, strong yet very feminine spirit!  10.</td>', 'I love the tonal quality of this picture and the detail especially in the beautiful lace.  Some halo appears around the bed post as a minor distraction to me.  This portrait is a very intimate and brave look into the life of a tremendous, strong yet very feminine spirit!  10.', '2006-10-20 12:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
