(2947785, 409991, 64446, '<td valign="top">Sharpness, focus and the sepia are great! Do I see your reflection in the spool?<br/>What bothers me the most in this image, though, is the composition with roasted coffe beans on a bowl - like a cereal, as it suggests - and you might know how bitter that is (maybe that was your intention with the whole set up to evoke such feelings in the viewrs...). So, it doesn''t fall well with me, but I am not taking any points because of that :-).</td>', 'Sharpness, focus and the sepia are great! Do I see your reflection in the spool?What bothers me the most in this image, though, is the composition with roasted coffe beans on a bowl - like a cereal, as it suggests - and you might know how bitter that is (maybe that was your intention with the whole set up to evoke such feelings in the viewrs...). So, it doesn''t fall well with me, but I am not taking any points because of that :-).', '2006-10-20 19:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2947800, 410787, 64446, '<td valign="top">You didn''t need the glasses or the booklet there - they are distracting.<br/>Then, you''d just have 3 elements to concentrate on. Having a more thick/continuous coffe flow and a mug half full would make a better impact.</td>', 'You didn''t need the glasses or the booklet there - they are distracting.Then, you''d just have 3 elements to concentrate on. Having a more thick/continuous coffe flow and a mug half full would make a better impact.', '2006-10-20 19:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
