(2950048, 411160, 67145, '<td valign="top">UGLY<br/><i>edit to say ... </i> <br/>this was my first comment ever in dpc and I DIDNT MAKE IT ... my daughter was looking in dpc and typed the comment and posted it ... at the time i didnt even know that i could edit it .. &amp; i would NEVER be so superficial!! lol ... :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-18 16:32:53.</i></td>', 'UGLYedit to say ...  this was my first comment ever in dpc and I DIDNT MAKE IT ... my daughter was looking in dpc and typed the comment and posted it ... at the time i didnt even know that i could edit it .. & i would NEVER be so superficial!! lol ... :)', '2006-10-21 22:06:12.000000', '2007-06-18 17:32:53.000000', 1),
(2950059, 410642, 22970, '<td valign="top">You intent was well but your photograph turned out to be a snap shot. Please don''t get me wrong I''m just trying to give advice. The composition is not good enough to make the picture eye appealing. The lighting and focus could of been better and the main thing is relating the picture to title. With a little though and time you could of picked a better location that would of showed the relation of morning, subject, and title.<br/> <br/>I hope this critique helps, it is not to be derogatory but the direct opposite - to try to help with advice.<br/> <br/>I wish you well in this and future challenges.</td>', 'You intent was well but your photograph turned out to be a snap shot. Please don''t get me wrong I''m just trying to give advice. The composition is not good enough to make the picture eye appealing. The lighting and focus could of been better and the main thing is relating the picture to title. With a little though and time you could of picked a better location that would of showed the relation of morning, subject, and title. I hope this critique helps, it is not to be derogatory but the direct opposite - to try to help with advice. I wish you well in this and future challenges.', '2006-10-21 22:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
