(2950079, 411819, 22970, '<td valign="top">The overall darkness of the photo with high saturated areas in the form of an abstract photo gives me no focus area.</td>', 'The overall darkness of the photo with high saturated areas in the form of an abstract photo gives me no focus area.', '2006-10-21 22:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2950210, 412232, 64446, '<td valign="top">Yammy! Colours, pastel tones and composition really attractive, inducing the viewer a morning atmosphere and on how delicious those pancakes must be. I wouldn''t call it fast though - it might take a while to work on them all... :-))</td>', 'Yammy! Colours, pastel tones and composition really attractive, inducing the viewer a morning atmosphere and on how delicious those pancakes must be. I wouldn''t call it fast though - it might take a while to work on them all... :-))', '2006-10-21 22:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2950315, 412204, 58683, '<td valign="top">I''m positive it wasn''t intentional, but my first reaction upon looking at this photo was to recall some odd/surrealist movies I''ve seen. Possibly due to the facial distortion from the mask. I like this, it''s fascinating. Good choice with the colouring. Perhaps looks a bit unbalanced or empty on the left side.</td>', 'I''m positive it wasn''t intentional, but my first reaction upon looking at this photo was to recall some odd/surrealist movies I''ve seen. Possibly due to the facial distortion from the mask. I like this, it''s fascinating. Good choice with the colouring. Perhaps looks a bit unbalanced or empty on the left side.', '2006-10-21 23:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2950325, 410817, 58683, '<td valign="top">It actually took me a few moments to figure this out. The angle took me a bit by surprise. The lighting is lovely although I''m not completely taken by the angle. My vision keeps returning to the slighly bulging eye which is accentuated by the angle. I''m nitpicking a bit though. Lovely photo.</td>', 'It actually took me a few moments to figure this out. The angle took me a bit by surprise. The lighting is lovely although I''m not completely taken by the angle. My vision keeps returning to the slighly bulging eye which is accentuated by the angle. I''m nitpicking a bit though. Lovely photo.', '2006-10-21 23:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2950336, 411580, 58683, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I really like the fact that you''ve managed to make a structure like that look tiny. Personally I don''t get an ominous feeling from this, perhaps more isolation. The colours are a little flat, although quite natural looking.</td>', 'Interesting. I really like the fact that you''ve managed to make a structure like that look tiny. Personally I don''t get an ominous feeling from this, perhaps more isolation. The colours are a little flat, although quite natural looking.', '2006-10-21 23:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2950341, 410813, 58683, '<td valign="top">I think this needs a little something more. The lighting almost suggests suspense to me. Maybe add a gun :-)</td>', 'I think this needs a little something more. The lighting almost suggests suspense to me. Maybe add a gun :-)', '2006-10-21 23:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
