(2951553, 409387, 19944, '<td valign="top">There''s just something about this that I love.  I can''t exactly put my finger on it, but there is something...or maybe many things.  The duotoning is great and I really like the white areas that some would say are blown out.  Well, thet are blown out, but it really seems to work.  This should really be a Top 10, if not a ribbon shot.</td>', 'There''s just something about this that I love.  I can''t exactly put my finger on it, but there is something...or maybe many things.  The duotoning is great and I really like the white areas that some would say are blown out.  Well, thet are blown out, but it really seems to work.  This should really be a Top 10, if not a ribbon shot.', '2006-10-22 15:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
