(2951568, 411204, 19944, '<td valign="top">I know that this is probably getting beaten to death in the scoring (and I really hope that I am wrong), but I just love these types of shots.  The color and movement are superb.  And you had the guts to enter a decidedly "Non-DPC" image.  Good for you.  The only gripe I would have is the pinkish stripe at the bottom right.  Being advanced editing, that would have been easy to get rid of, as to me, it just doesn''t seem to belong with the yellow &amp; orange.</td>', 'I know that this is probably getting beaten to death in the scoring (and I really hope that I am wrong), but I just love these types of shots.  The color and movement are superb.  And you had the guts to enter a decidedly "Non-DPC" image.  Good for you.  The only gripe I would have is the pinkish stripe at the bottom right.  Being advanced editing, that would have been easy to get rid of, as to me, it just doesn''t seem to belong with the yellow & orange.', '2006-10-22 15:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
