(2952129, 411568, 61191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, the sky is amazing! Looks as if you saturated the fog to much: the colors look grainy.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, the sky is amazing! Looks as if you saturated the fog to much: the colors look grainy.', '2006-10-22 21:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952131, 411718, 61191, '<td valign="top">Quite interesting shot. I like your composition and the colors.</td>', 'Quite interesting shot. I like your composition and the colors.', '2006-10-22 21:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952150, 410470, 61191, '<td valign="top">What a great shot! The look on here face, the nighdress, the curlers, the way she smokes her cigarette, her bored look into the newspaper for jobs and finally the outstanding ironic title: I love how you took care of all those details! A very well forethought shot. Lighting, contrast, compositon are excellent! I would had a guilty conscience if I would not give you a 10. Great work!</td>', 'What a great shot! The look on here face, the nighdress, the curlers, the way she smokes her cigarette, her bored look into the newspaper for jobs and finally the outstanding ironic title: I love how you took care of all those details! A very well forethought shot. Lighting, contrast, compositon are excellent! I would had a guilty conscience if I would not give you a 10. Great work!', '2006-10-22 21:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952165, 412134, 36371, '<td valign="top">What a find! Love the title and the lighting is magical. 10</td>', 'What a find! Love the title and the lighting is magical. 10', '2006-10-22 21:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952168, 412323, 61191, '<td valign="top">That''s what I want to do sooo often! (I think you got comments like this a 100 times.) Great idea! I must say I don''t like how you used the ceiling and the curtain in your composition: I would have left out the ceiling and include more of the curtain.</td>', 'That''s what I want to do sooo often! (I think you got comments like this a 100 times.) Great idea! I must say I don''t like how you used the ceiling and the curtain in your composition: I would have left out the ceiling and include more of the curtain.', '2006-10-22 21:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952170, 411966, 61191, '<td valign="top">Great find! Love composition and colors.</td>', 'Great find! Love composition and colors.', '2006-10-22 21:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952171, 411916, 61191, '<td valign="top">Oh wow! Beautiful shot, the colors are amazing!</td>', 'Oh wow! Beautiful shot, the colors are amazing!', '2006-10-22 21:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952176, 408915, 61191, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, well done! Extra points for thinking outside the box.</td>', 'Interesting idea, well done! Extra points for thinking outside the box.', '2006-10-22 21:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
