(2952230, 411916, 10818, '<td valign="top">Yeah it does, but having an awesome setting helps also.  <br/> <br/>That is just gorgeous, fantastic photo.</td>', 'Yeah it does, but having an awesome setting helps also.   That is just gorgeous, fantastic photo.', '2006-10-22 22:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952238, 412232, 53147, '<td valign="top">Back to comment. This feels like a pic from a Southern Living or BH&amp;G magazine. Great composition, colors, focus and blur. Just an excellent picture overall. A pleasant departure from the oversaturated sunrises (and mine was one of those) and the poorly shot coffee cups. This shot belongs in a food publication all the way and I hope it scores well for you. Bumping up 2. Edit - on second thought (or third as it would be) you get the last bump up - 10 for me. Ok - back one last time. Gonna add this to my fav list and I need to add a reminder to put syrup on tomorrows shopping list.</td>', 'Back to comment. This feels like a pic from a Southern Living or BH&G magazine. Great composition, colors, focus and blur. Just an excellent picture overall. A pleasant departure from the oversaturated sunrises (and mine was one of those) and the poorly shot coffee cups. This shot belongs in a food publication all the way and I hope it scores well for you. Bumping up 2. Edit - on second thought (or third as it would be) you get the last bump up - 10 for me. Ok - back one last time. Gonna add this to my fav list and I need to add a reminder to put syrup on tomorrows shopping list.', '2006-10-22 22:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952243, 410282, 67413, '<td valign="top">I have just noticed that my comment from the other day is now GONE...?<br/> <br/>That means that I have the pleasure of commenting on this imaginative idea and the great execution for this photo...again!<br/>The colors certainly capture my attention quickly as I scan the thumbnails.<br/>The placement of the silhouette draws you into the picture and the light seems to explode before your eyes.<br/>It is amazing how so few colors, and select ones at that, can create such a dramatic effect.<br/>This is a very simple photo, but one with that conveys emotion, strong emotion.<br/>This will sell!<br/>Very well done!<br/>I enjoyed coming back to see it again!<br/> <br/>For a few memories more that forty years I have chased Sunrises and Sunsets for my heart and for a living, and it is always nice to see a photo that is like looking in a mirror to see a memory, a very warm one.<br/> <br/>Thanks!<br/>Rohn</td>', 'I have just noticed that my comment from the other day is now GONE...? That means that I have the pleasure of commenting on this imaginative idea and the great execution for this photo...again!The colors certainly capture my attention quickly as I scan the thumbnails.The placement of the silhouette draws you into the picture and the light seems to explode before your eyes.It is amazing how so few colors, and select ones at that, can create such a dramatic effect.This is a very simple photo, but one with that conveys emotion, strong emotion.This will sell!Very well done!I enjoyed coming back to see it again! For a few memories more that forty years I have chased Sunrises and Sunsets for my heart and for a living, and it is always nice to see a photo that is like looking in a mirror to see a memory, a very warm one. Thanks!Rohn', '2006-10-22 22:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952244, 412096, 55767, '<td valign="top">I love the expression on his face.</td>', 'I love the expression on his face.', '2006-10-22 22:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952365, 409321, 12268, '<td valign="top">adorable dog. Sharpness of the eye really makes it pop and adds the cuteness for sure.</td>', 'adorable dog. Sharpness of the eye really makes it pop and adds the cuteness for sure.', '2006-10-22 22:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952368, 410907, 12268, '<td valign="top">wow! This is something to wake up to. Exellent exposire and nice capture. Good luck!</td>', 'wow! This is something to wake up to. Exellent exposire and nice capture. Good luck!', '2006-10-22 22:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952373, 411968, 12268, '<td valign="top">nice alarm clock. :P I like the motion blur here as it adds some emphasis. Good luck!</td>', 'nice alarm clock. :P I like the motion blur here as it adds some emphasis. Good luck!', '2006-10-22 22:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
