(2952403, 412092, 67413, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome photo!<br/>When you have ingredients like Water, Boats, Fall Colors, Dramatic sky and the Sun''s warm colors, it only follows that scenes like this exist for the appreciative eyes of those whose presence is part of this exquisite grandeur!<br/> <br/>Thanks for the Dream...!<br/>Rohn</td>', 'This is an awesome photo!When you have ingredients like Water, Boats, Fall Colors, Dramatic sky and the Sun''s warm colors, it only follows that scenes like this exist for the appreciative eyes of those whose presence is part of this exquisite grandeur! Thanks for the Dream...!Rohn', '2006-10-22 23:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
