(2960507, 409522, 25095, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bigdipper:</b></div><hr/><i> That looks too much like a sunset to work properly for me. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This was taken just after the sun broke through the clouds in the morning.  I sure hope you did as the site recommends and voted it as it is a legal image and not what you thought it was.  <br/> <br/>Hate to think I lost points just because someone didn''t think it was morning.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by bigdipper: That looks too much like a sunset to work properly for me.   This was taken just after the sun broke through the clouds in the morning.  I sure hope you did as the site recommends and voted it as it is a legal image and not what you thought it was.   Hate to think I lost points just because someone didn''t think it was morning.', '2006-10-25 08:46:23.000000', NULL, 0),
