(2961673, 409063, 53316, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>Wow, this is very pretty!  The colors are just awesome.  The composition is very serene - it looks so nice that I wonder if you didn''t ask the deer to pose nicely for you ;-D  I love the flowers, the shadows around the bottom, and how the deer seems to look right at the viewer.  The almost-gradient from lighter colors at the top to darker at the bottom makes for an exquisite effect.<br/> <br/>As others have said, this looks like a painting.  Personally I find that wonderful to look at.  From a photographic standpoint, however, it doesn''t seem as "alive" as I would expect a photo to be.  It seems very flat and noisy.  The commenters, and myself, like the effect but I would imagine that other people might not, which probably did hurt your score.<br/> <br/>All in all, congrats on such a GORGEOUS shot!!  You might have some luck selling this as a print because it truly is lovely.</td>', '*Critique Club* Wow, this is very pretty!  The colors are just awesome.  The composition is very serene - it looks so nice that I wonder if you didn''t ask the deer to pose nicely for you ;-D  I love the flowers, the shadows around the bottom, and how the deer seems to look right at the viewer.  The almost-gradient from lighter colors at the top to darker at the bottom makes for an exquisite effect. As others have said, this looks like a painting.  Personally I find that wonderful to look at.  From a photographic standpoint, however, it doesn''t seem as "alive" as I would expect a photo to be.  It seems very flat and noisy.  The commenters, and myself, like the effect but I would imagine that other people might not, which probably did hurt your score. All in all, congrats on such a GORGEOUS shot!!  You might have some luck selling this as a print because it truly is lovely.', '2006-10-25 14:03:10.000000', NULL, 0),
