(2972128, 411866, 30861, '<td valign="top">Oh, hey! You got unjustifiably hammered on this one :-) I gave it a 7 myself, it was one of my favorites in the challenge. I guess it''s no surprise that so many people reacted negatively, but I think the image is very well done, stark and moody and true-to-life. I''m gonna fave it, least I can do :-)</td>', 'Oh, hey! You got unjustifiably hammered on this one :-) I gave it a 7 myself, it was one of my favorites in the challenge. I guess it''s no surprise that so many people reacted negatively, but I think the image is very well done, stark and moody and true-to-life. I''m gonna fave it, least I can do :-)', '2006-10-29 01:12:07.000000', NULL, 0),
