(2978939, 410470, 42100, '<td valign="top">I really wanted to comment on this during voting but didn''t get a chance before going on vacation.  I just wanted to let you know how great I thought this was, and nobody knows to have more fun than you taking photos(it''s just so obvious).  Congrats on a PB and a 7+ score, and here''s to many, many more!</td>', 'I really wanted to comment on this during voting but didn''t get a chance before going on vacation.  I just wanted to let you know how great I thought this was, and nobody knows to have more fun than you taking photos(it''s just so obvious).  Congrats on a PB and a 7+ score, and here''s to many, many more!', '2006-10-31 14:34:16.000000', NULL, 0),
