(3025563, 410470, 28742, '<td valign="top">...Now how did I miss this?? Just beautiful, Judy! Gorgeous. You never looked better. Hubba hubba. ROFL! Just ribbin ya. What I meant to say is you musta done some heavy post-proc to strip away your normal, natural beauty. :) Congrats in a big way! Very well done!</td>', '...Now how did I miss this?? Just beautiful, Judy! Gorgeous. You never looked better. Hubba hubba. ROFL! Just ribbin ya. What I meant to say is you musta done some heavy post-proc to strip away your normal, natural beauty. :) Congrats in a big way! Very well done!', '2006-11-13 05:04:49.000000', NULL, 0),
