(3032559, 412223, 60862, '<td valign="top">Hey, welcome back!  Well, at least a month ago, anyway. :)<br/> <br/>This is just another in a series of great shots from you.  Someday maybe I''ll be able to toss something together and whip off a 6+ score.</td>', 'Hey, welcome back!  Well, at least a month ago, anyway. :) This is just another in a series of great shots from you.  Someday maybe I''ll be able to toss something together and whip off a 6+ score.', '2006-11-15 00:30:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3034342, 411149, 29011, '<td valign="top">I really like the shot, one of my favorite from the challenge. Love how you created the abstract look with the top persective, working with the circlular shapes as such. I like the two plates below overlapping eachother just a bit, but not sure about the clipped cup handle. And with everything being in focus, only the flower isn''t, I guess that can work either way with this being an abstract. If it was in focus it might have taken away too much focus from the other objects, tough call.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-16 01:25:51.</i></td>', 'I really like the shot, one of my favorite from the challenge. Love how you created the abstract look with the top persective, working with the circlular shapes as such. I like the two plates below overlapping eachother just a bit, but not sure about the clipped cup handle. And with everything being in focus, only the flower isn''t, I guess that can work either way with this being an abstract. If it was in focus it might have taken away too much focus from the other objects, tough call.', '2006-11-15 12:58:48.000000', '2006-11-16 01:25:51.000000', 0),
(3037362, 410229, 66333, '<td valign="top">I like this one too. You''ve got a great eye. Why do you use the Leica so much, ahead of your 30D? Not suggesting you should, but the Canon is a much better piece of kit!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-16 10:55:36.</i></td>', 'I like this one too. You''ve got a great eye. Why do you use the Leica so much, ahead of your 30D? Not suggesting you should, but the Canon is a much better piece of kit!', '2006-11-16 10:55:11.000000', '2006-11-16 10:55:36.000000', 0),
